<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffeaa7 0%, #fab1a0 50%, #fd79a8 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .container {
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            max-width: 600px;
        }
        
        h1 {
            color: #2d3436;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        p {
            color: #636e72;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .gatito-container {
            margin: 30px 0;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .gatito-image {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .gatito-image:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #fd79a8, #fdcb6e);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(253, 121, 168, 0.4);
        }
        
        .gatito-facts {
            background: rgba(253, 121, 168, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .gatito-facts h3 {
            color: #fd79a8;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1><%= title %></h1>
        <p><%= message %></p>
        
        <div class="gatito-container">
            <img src="/images/gatito.jpg" alt="Adorable gatito" class="gatito-image">
        </div>
        
        <div class="gatito-facts">
            <h3>¿Sabías que...? 🐾</h3>
            <p>Los gatos pueden hacer más de 100 sonidos vocales diferentes, mientras que los perros solo pueden hacer unos 10.</p>
        </div>
        
        <a href="/" class="btn">🏠 Volver al Inicio</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>